{"id": "34560", "title": "女强人", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34560.htm", "intro": "她家娘亲有交代，靠山，山倒；靠男人，男人跑，女人靠自己最好！所以，她十三岁开始立志当个女强人！瞧——新世代企业救火队；商界新彗星，现代财神爷化身的美丽佳人；美丽又有才能，行事手腕不让须眉的新时代女性……呵！上头那些都是外界对她的评价吗？那她真是当之无愧啊！只是，她到底是个小女人，她也渴望爱情，渴望有人疼，而这个男人——这个锋芒不外显的男人，才是狠角色！和他在一起真个教人如沐春风的——舒服啊！如果她同他告白，不知会不会吓跑他？不管了！先下手为强！谁要他碰上的是个女强人咧！嘿嘿……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34560", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2191605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191622.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191623.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "fi